\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"brX0OWBdrRs","position":36,"timestamp":"01:22:47","rawTrack":"Mos Def - The Boogie Man Song","track":{"id":"uueL4_yawYI","path":"/artists/mos-def/tracks/the-boogie-man-song/","slug":"the-boogie-man-song","title":"The Boogie Man Song","artist":{"slug":"mos-def","title":"Mos Def"},"artwork":"images/artists/mos-def/tracks/the-boogie-man-song.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"wCbMLdi8kZ8","slug":"528","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-528/ra.1592604933","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-528"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #528","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-528.jpg","content":"Music from Aminé, Twenty Weeks, Wun Two, and Khruangbin.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-11-06T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"Mu3NqmVWrhE","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mos Def - The Panties","track":{"id":"64fWf0JUyd8","path":"/artists/mos-def/tracks/the-panties/","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties","artist":{"slug":"mos-def","title":"Mos Def"},"artwork":"images/artists/mos-def/tracks/the-panties.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays Set","position":2}},{"id":"jnxA54JkoBw","position":41,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mos Def - Boogie Man Song","track":{"id":"z4MauVL1zo8","path":"/artists/mos-def/tracks/boogie-man-song/","slug":"boogie-man-song","title":"Boogie Man Song","artist":{"slug":"mos-def","title":"Mos Def"},"artwork":"images/artists/mos-def/tracks/boogie-man-song.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-148"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10830,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"DQGcyoP--TM","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mos Def - Umi Says","track":{"id":"1ere2TpvwTA","path":"/artists/mos-def/tracks/umi-says/","slug":"umi-says","title":"UMI Says","artist":{"slug":"mos-def","title":"Mos Def"},"artwork":"images/artists/mos-def/tracks/umi-says.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"hu9AJ6V7gHY","position":31,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mos Def - Boogie Man Song","track":{"id":"z4MauVL1zo8","path":"/artists/mos-def/tracks/boogie-man-song/","slug":"boogie-man-song","title":"Boogie Man Song","artist":{"slug":"mos-def","title":"Mos Def"},"artwork":"images/artists/mos-def/tracks/boogie-man-song.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ds5J8Q4FpEQ","slug":"174","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-174-w-iman-omari"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #174 w/ Iman Omari","artwork":"/images/episodes/174.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11043,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-10T01:00:00+00:00"},"title